  "body": "## Release Notes\r\n\r\n### Features\r\n\r\n- Command cancellation functionality\r\n- Added input file handling to script generation\r\n\r\n## Install rura 1.14.0\r\n\r\n### Install prebuilt binaries via shell script\r\n\r\n```sh\r\ncurl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -LsSf https://github.com/tlipinski/rura/releases/download/v1.14.0/rura-installer.sh | sh\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Download rura 1.14.0\r\n\r\n|  File  | Platform | Checksum |\r\n|--------|----------|----------|\r\n| [rura-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz](https://github.com/tlipinski/rura/releases/download/v1.14.0/rura-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz) | Apple Silicon macOS | [checksum](https://github.com/tlipinski/rura/releases/download/v1.14.0/rura-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz.sha256) |\r\n| [rura-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz](https://github.com/tlipinski/rura/releases/download/v1.14.0/rura-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz) | Intel macOS | [checksum](https://github.com/tlipinski/rura/releases/download/v1.14.0/rura-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz.sha256) |\r\n| [rura-aarch64-pc-windows-msvc.zip](https://github.com/tlipinski/rura/releases/download/v1.14.0/rura-aarch64-pc-windows-msvc.zip) | ARM64 Windows | [checksum](https://github.com/tlipinski/rura/releases/download/v1.14.0/rura-aarch64-pc-windows-msvc.zip.sha256) |\r\n| [rura-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip](https://github.com/tlipinski/rura/releases/download/v1.14.0/rura-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip) | x64 Windows | [checksum](https://github.com/tlipinski/rura/releases/download/v1.14.0/rura-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip.sha256) |\r\n| [rura-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz](https://github.com/tlipinski/rura/releases/download/v1.14.0/rura-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz) | ARM64 Linux | [checksum](https://github.com/tlipinski/rura/releases/download/v1.14.0/rura-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz.sha256) |\r\n| [rura-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz](https://github.com/tlipinski/rura/releases/download/v1.14.0/rura-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz) | x64 Linux | [checksum](https://github.